# Desktop client configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` only if you need to override a default. With no .env at all
# the client talks to the live backend, which is what an installed copy on a
# staff machine should do.

# The backend the desktop client talks to.
#
# Default (no .env needed):
#   https://monitra-lvzq.vercel.app
#
# Uncomment to develop against a backend running on this machine. Remember it
# must actually be running, or the client will correctly report the server as
# unreachable:
# SMS_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# Do NOT append /api/v1. The desktop calls the bare paths (/auth/me,
# /projects, /time-entries), which backend/app/main.py registers alongside the
# prefixed ones.
